      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "•\tConsider optimization of NarrowStringToWide() (and wide to narrow) – avoiding double call to Multibteytowide () – by taking a GUESS, and then trimming back the reallocated size?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tTest performance difference – using search profiling in HealthFrame – where this function shows up as significant. ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tMaybe hard to test performance impact cuz it depends on overhead of having realloced too much!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tMAYBE API is written so that you can GUESS, and convert with guess and if you win your are done and if you miss, you use the error code (which hopefully includes real lengthneeded) – to try again…",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
